                                  RiffleUpperV2.tv\n                                                (RiffleUpperV2.physicalInverseLaw\n                                                  (RiffleUpperV2.EmpiricalUpper.restartCuts cuts r))\n                                                (RiffleUpperV2.uniformPermutation N)"}
